{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Return to the world of medieval trade and ambition.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into your caravan master\u2019s boots once more in <i>Silk Roads II: Paths of Fortune</i> \u2014 this immersive trading simulation expands on the beloved original with deeper systems, dynamic world events, and a rich cast of characters to command and contend with.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667850/extras/50a409d1381ed3830bf8729d3dd26144.avif?t=1761506873\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667850/extras_big/50a409d1381ed3830bf8729d3dd26144.avif?t=1761506873 width=800 height=244 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667850/extras/537ff4883bbf1c39828228ed4cd6381e.poster.avif?t=1761506873\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667850/extras/537ff4883bbf1c39828228ed4cd6381e.webm?t=1761506873\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667850/extras/537ff4883bbf1c39828228ed4cd6381e.mp4?t=1761506873\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each journey is its own challenge. <br>Choose specialized animals and companions to traverse deserts, mountains, jungles and more. Discover new cities, develop your own routes and encounter obstacles on the paths of fortune.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667850/extras/eb0d2d87b75ee1447aecdc70fb85e101.avif?t=1761506873\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667850/extras_big/eb0d2d87b75ee1447aecdc70fb85e101.avif?t=1761506873 width=800 height=244 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667850/extras/b2eaffb6d0e7906ffeb642cd1302570c.poster.avif?t=1761506873\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667850/extras/b2eaffb6d0e7906ffeb642cd1302570c.webm?t=1761506873\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667850/extras/b2eaffb6d0e7906ffeb642cd1302570c.mp4?t=1761506873\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruit unique characters from across the Silk Roads, each with their own traits, skills, and personalities \u2014 complete with both benefits and drawbacks.<br>Negotiate their contracts, manage their morale, and help them grow in experience and wealth\u2026 or risk losing them to rival caravans.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667850/extras/525395be1040f56b97db8dd246a1be2a.avif?t=1761506873\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667850/extras_big/525395be1040f56b97db8dd246a1be2a.avif?t=1761506873 width=800 height=244 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667850/extras/ce8cd93d7b08902d7b053e5705403f67.poster.avif?t=1761506873\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667850/extras/ce8cd93d7b08902d7b053e5705403f67.webm?t=1761506873\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667850/extras/ce8cd93d7b08902d7b053e5705403f67.mp4?t=1761506873\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deal in a wide array of goods across cultural and regional lines, from rare Cathayan silks to steppe furs. <br>Earn the trust of cities and factions to access their most valuable wares \u2014 reputation is everything when chasing fortune.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667850/extras/fc6f9837668c268073f538f0a08a39be.avif?t=1761506873\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667850/extras_big/fc6f9837668c268073f538f0a08a39be.avif?t=1761506873 width=800 height=244 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667850/extras/deb94abee216cceb50d0e006d5bbf14b.poster.avif?t=1761506873\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667850/extras/deb94abee216cceb50d0e006d5bbf14b.webm?t=1761506873\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667850/extras/deb94abee216cceb50d0e006d5bbf14b.mp4?t=1761506873\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Managing a caravan is more than buying low and selling high. Assign tasks like foraging, guarding, or repairing \u2014 but don\u2019t forget to rest your crew. A tired caravan is a slow and vulnerable one.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667850/extras/eb4a1d417864b287ab729abb24dbb74d.avif?t=1761506873\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667850/extras_big/eb4a1d417864b287ab729abb24dbb74d.avif?t=1761506873 width=800 height=244 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cities go to war. Markets crash and surge. Roads become perilous or profitable.<br><i>Silk Roads II</i> features a living world that evolves as you play. Events can open new opportunities or cut off familiar paths \u2014 and your decisions can shape the outcome.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667850/extras/3d9e61f8349b40274c633b6d5dd5f300.avif?t=1761506873\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667850/extras_big/3d9e61f8349b40274c633b6d5dd5f300.avif?t=1761506873 width=800 height=244 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Return to Venice to buy back your stake in the Colleganza, increasing your share of the profits.<br>But beware \u2014 the more skilled your companions, the more they\u2019ll demand a cut for themselves.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Helping Hand","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3667850/3597f68d59171b5d48e4a445b94411c7697de506.jpg"},{"name":"Horsing Around","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3667850/b649466645f5c4c0a220c2339f3073e016d2d41b.jpg"},{"name":"Crowded","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3667850/05f641927f3d5603171f0cc4c04e001c486d7b94.jpg"},{"name":"Heroic","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3667850/efe2e581e1271d3d1ced80ab001ec15110f7bc5a.jpg"},{"name":"Legendary","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3667850/c693a8f82ec6b8e4f9acce95f0e272af957fb9f0.jpg"},{"name":"Can I keep them?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3667850/fd5a722f5127453ef063007c43ebe9246b84789d.jpg"},{"name":"Heavy","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3667850/18fb2da414731598fd5b6a646f6f53b134b673c5.jpg"},{"name":"Skilled","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3667850/c8a5c9bd20699d3785eba61ec731c34196bb399e.jpg"},{"name":"Talented Hands","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3667850/bc818485b8d0cdd388424498029fed0c2ca4e329.jpg"},{"name":"Well Rounded","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3667850/08a69fad24e390057aec288798182a0c89811287.jpg"}],"total":25},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3667850?t=1761506873","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3667850?t=1761506873","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667850/d396d23bf0a5d1fd3215d5e70bf2f506bc4daadf/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761506873","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667850/d396d23bf0a5d1fd3215d5e70bf2f506bc4daadf/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761506873","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3781660,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Return to the world of medieval trade and ambition.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into your caravan master\u2019s boots once more in <i>Silk Roads II: Paths of Fortune</i> \u2014 this immersive trading simulation expands on the beloved original with deeper systems, dynamic world events, and a rich cast of characters to command and con